OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of attacking driver
OL,4,Aand stealing bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA court has heard how a man allegedly
OL,7,Fassaulted a bus driver and stole his
OL,8,Fvehicle, before crashing into a row of
OL,9,Fparked cars.
OL,11,FAli Balhad, 33, faces a total of 10
OL,12,Fcharges relating to three separate
OL,13,Fincidents between 16 and 18 September.
OL,15,FSeven of the offences relate to the
OL,16,Fincident involving a bus on Court
OL,17,FStreet in Madeley, Telford, at about
OL,18,F18:30 BST on Friday.
